-ce7e5ad9d98ffe24","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-06T00:00:00","source":"MarketScreener India"},{"id":"422350","title":"Jubilant Biosys, a subsidiary of Jubilant Pharmova, faces a GST demand of Rs.9.7 Cr for FY 2020-23.\nThe company plans to appeal the order, stating no material financial or operational impact.","summary":"Jubilant Biosys, a subsidiary of Jubilant Pharmova, faces a GST demand of Rs.9.7 Cr for FY 2020-23.\nThe company plans to appeal the order, stating no material financial or operational impact.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=237d9c34-2d27-44f6-99f4-6469200cefb2.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2025-12-25T18:48:47","source":"BSE"},{"id":"401558","title":"Jubilant Biosys received GST Adjudication Order for FY 2021-22, demanding Rs. 6.65 Cr tax, Rs. 4.32 Cr interest, Rs. 66.48 L penalty.\nCompany plans to contest the order, expecting no financial or operational impact; details posted on jubilantpharmova.com.","summary":"Jubilant Biosys received GST Adjudication Order for FY 2021-22, demanding Rs. 6.65 Cr tax, Rs. 4.32 Cr interest, Rs. 66.48 L penalty.\nCompany plans to contest the order, expecting no financial or operational impact; details posted on jubilantpharmova.com.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d34481a1-5f26-4c75-9b08-12490479321e.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2025-12-05T16:46:36","source":"BSE"}]}]